{
  "TRANSACTION - FUNCTIONAL DESCRIPTION": "Modifies a pricing rule that is being used for payments on EVA platform",
  "EXECUTION FLOWS - DETAILED DESCRIPTION": "The transaction obtains the pricing rule identifier, the pricing rule request and the audit user identifier from the request header. It invokes ABKOR001.executePutPricingRules(pricingRuleId, pricingRuleRequest, auditUserId), which retrieves the existing pricing rule, validates its active status and modifiable state, validates the effective date and restricted changes, checks for active child rules when applicable, validates duplicate pricing rules, fills detail values, synchronizes or updates the pricing rule in the database, and returns the modified pricing rule. The returned pricing rule is assigned to pricingRuleResponse. If the transaction receives any advice from the library, it assigns severity EWR, mapped to ERROR WITH ROLLBACK.",
